    "updated_at": "2026-01-29T20:26:44Z",
    "body": "As to the why: as a design system author i want to stay as close to the platform as possible while at the same time adhering to the styleguide of the design system. The custom element of the OP matches that scenario:\n- Allowing custom styling of the select in the shadow DOM (so no global styles necessary, other than design tokens)\n- Having users slot `<option>`s in the select. No workarounds necessary, just use the same element devs are used to.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
