    "body": "@josepharhar I wonder if you could talk more to how you see this evolving, wrt other form controls. It seems to make sense that if we allow this for `<select>` we should allow this for `<datalist>`. Does that get messy? What about `<fieldset disabled>`, should that mark slotted elements disabled? What about `<form>` itself (see https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10220)? I imagine `<form>` would be the riskiest in terms of web compatibility (especially concerning would be FACE, I guess?).\n\nIf we only do this for `<select>` that it feels like we end up with a somewhat inconsistent set of form controls (some traverse flat tree where others don't). But is it feasible to extend this to more?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
