    "body": "> In general none of HTML's elements currently support this. E.g., this doesn't work for table. I'm not convinced (yet) that solving this in isolation for select is a good idea.\n\nWith the amount of ask from the community, I think it could make sense to solve it in isolation for select element.\n\n> We also still have many outstanding issues with shadow trees and the revised select element that seem higher priority to address.\n\nAgree and let's get them done :)",
